车会被黑方进炮封锁，方向明显有误。应车一进一准备平六攻击黑拐脚马容易掌握先手。","text":"出直车会被黑方进炮封锁，方向明显有误。应车一进一准备平六攻击黑拐脚马容易掌握先手。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"感觉炮8进4封车更有针对性。","text":"感觉炮8进4封车更有针对性。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"现在进车捉炮没有后续手段，兵七进一让黑车通头也不妥，所以只有走马七进六弃兵抢攻。","text":"现在进车捉炮没有后续手段，兵七进一让黑车通头也不妥，所以只有走马七进六弃兵抢攻。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment22","raw_text":"黑方抢到进炮封车这步棋后，形势满意。","text":"黑方抢到进炮封车这步棋后，形势满意。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment23","raw_text":"挺兵为小利所累，应兵五进一不让黑先手打中兵更要紧。","text":"挺兵为小利所累，应兵五进一不让黑先手打中兵更要紧。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"0:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"改走炮5平9顺手吃兵伏沉底炮牵制红方更好。","text":"改走炮5平9顺手吃兵伏沉底炮牵制红方更好。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"挺兵消极，被黑车占据要道后再无翻身机会。应改走炮三平四腾出马位，并有进炮顶马等作用，红方不差。||以下黑如炮5平9，兵三进一，炮9进3，炮四进五，士5进6，兵三进一，红双兵渡河形势乐观。又如黑车2进5则马二进三伏炮四进五得子。","text":"挺兵消极，被黑车占据要道后再无翻身机会。应改走炮三平四腾出马位，并有进炮顶马等作用，红方不差。\n以下黑如炮5平9，兵三进一，炮9进3，炮四进五，士5进6，兵三进一，红双兵渡河形势乐观。又如黑车2进5则马二进三伏炮四进五得子。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":"进兵太缓，应马三进五兑掉黑炮拉长战线。","text":"进兵太缓，应马三进五兑掉黑炮拉长战线。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment50:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment50","raw_text":"黑方经过简单交换，获得胜势残局。","text":"黑方经过简单交换，获得胜势残局。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":50,"anchor_node_id":"0:50","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment55:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment55","raw_text":"慌不择路，被黑顺手吃掉过河兵。","text":"慌不择路，被黑顺手吃掉过河兵。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":55,"anchor_node_id":"0:55","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment56:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment56","raw_text":"黑胜||残局黑双马优于双炮还净多双卒一象胜定。","text":"黑胜\n残局黑双马优于双炮还净多双卒一象胜定。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":56,"anchor_node_id":"0:56","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["13 张锦荣 先负 万启有"],"DhtmlXQ_event":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["张锦荣"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["万启有"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["黑胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["E46 对兵转兵底炮"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_author":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":31,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":56,"legal_move_records":56,"annotations":12,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":12}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-59","category_id":"59","title":"第三部分 各地名手实战对局 张锦荣先负万启有第1局","catalogue_order":257,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-59-11.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-59"]}}
